    "title": {
      "en": "Glory of the Wartorn Hero Achievement Changes in Patch 12.1.5 - PTR Development Notes",
      "es": "Cambios en el logro de héroes de Glory of the Wartorn en el parche 12.1.5 - Notas de desarrollo de PTR"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Glory of the Wartorn Hero Achievement Changes in Patch 12.1.5 - PTR Development Notes...",
      "es": "Cambios en el logro de héroes de Glory of the Wartorn en el parche 12.1.5 - Notas de desarrollo de PTR..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab313ecd67b09.78851921\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has posted Patch 12.1.5 PTR development notes for today, removing some of the required achievements for the BFA dungeon meta achievement.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/patch-12-1-5-overview-features-activities-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Patch 12.1.5 Overview</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/8214194.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>In Battle for Azeroth, players could complete achievements across every BFA dungeon to obtain <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12812/glory-of-the-wartorn-hero\"><img alt=\"Glory of the Wartorn Hero\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raiddeathknightmythic_s_01.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Glory of the Wartorn Hero</span></a>, and completing this achievement awards the <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=161215/reins-of-the-obsidian-krolusk\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Reins of the Obsidian Krolusk\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trilobitemount_black.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Reins of the Obsidian Krolusk</span></a> mount. With the rework of Temple of Sethraliss in Season 2 of Midnight, some of these achievements are no longer possible, and the achievement is being updated to account for this. <br><br>For example, the <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12508/good-night-sweet-prince\"><img alt=\"Good Night, Sweet Prince\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shaman_hex.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Good Night, Sweet Prince</span></a> required players to /<wbr>kiss the Plague Toads until one of them spawned into a Prince. With the Midnight Season 2 rework, Plague Toads no longer exist in the Avatar of Sethraliss encounter.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2344395/5\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The 12.1.5 PTR has been updated for the week.<h2 id=\"achievements\" class=\"heading-size-2\"><b>ACHIEVEMENTS</b></h2><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The achievements <i>Snake Eyes</i>, <i>Snake Eater</i>, and <i>Good Night, Sweet Prince</i> are no longer required to complete the achievement <i>Glory of the Wartorn Hero</i>.</div></li></ul></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has posted Patch 12.1.5 PTR development notes for today, removing some of the required achievements for the BFA dungeon meta achievement.<br /><br />Patch 12.1.5 Overview<br /><br />In Battle for Azeroth, players could complete achievements across every BFA dungeon to obtain <a href=\"/achievement=12812/glory-of-the-wartorn-hero\">Glory of the Wartorn Hero</a>, and completing this achievement awards the <a href=\"/item=161215/reins-of-the-obsidian-krolusk\">Reins of the Obsidian Krolusk</a> mount. With the rework of Temple of Sethraliss in Season 2 of Midnight, some of these achievements are no longer possible, and the achievement is being updated to account for this. <br /><br />For example, the <a href=\"/achievement=12508/good-night-sweet-prince\">Good Night, Sweet Prince</a> required players to /kiss the Plague Toads until one of them spawned into a Prince. With the Midnight Season 2 rework, Plague Toads no longer exist in the Avatar of Sethraliss encounter.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">The 12.1.5 PTR has been updated for the week.<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\"><b>ACHIEVEMENTS</b></h2><br /><ul><li>The achievements <i>Snake Eyes</i>, <i>Snake Eater</i>, and <i>Good Night, Sweet Prince</i> are no longer required to complete the achievement <i>Glory of the Wartorn Hero</i>.</li></ul></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
