    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab315273747d4.67666580\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"event\" data-entity=\"event\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/event=1636/winds-of-mysterious-fortune\"><img alt=\"Winds of Mysterious Fortune\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/calendar_dragonflightstart.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Winds of Mysterious Fortune</span></a> event ends tomorrow at 1 PM PDT, just a little less than 24 hours from now, so get in any last-minute leveling or reputation grinds before it disappears again!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/world-events/winds-of-mysterious-fortune-buff-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Winds of Mysterious Fortune Event Guide</span></a></div><div class=\"injected-ad-container\"><div class=\"htlad-desktop-dynamic-btf\"></div></div><br><br>As usual, the winds feature a global buff for all players, featuring increased experience and reputation gains for almost everything outside of current content.<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">20% bonus experience from level 10 to 89.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">50% bonus reputation, excluding Zul'jarra's Forces and Captain Tokka's Crew.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Quests and kills while leveling characters can earn Mysterious Satchels.</div></li></ul>As a bonus, it also included a brand-new Feat of Strength achievement offering bonus <a class=\"icontiny q1\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"currency\" data-entity=\"currency\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/currency=2032/traders-tender\"><span><img alt=\"Trader's Tender\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/tradingpostcurrency.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Trader's Tender</span></span></a>, which is very welcome in light of <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/september-trading-post-brings-back-over-300-player-favorites-and-previous-382696\" data-contiguous=\"true\">more than 300 items returning in this month's anniversary trading post</a>. While it's now too late to complete from start to finish, most active players should have already been getting credit naturally.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1298148.jpg\" id=\"1298148\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1298148.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"winds screenshot\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"></a></div><br><br>The end of this most recent Winds event could also be an unofficial confirmation that Patch 12.1.5 is about to arrive. Although we have not yet gotten an official confirmation of the patch date, these events often bookend patches, allowing players to more easily catch up before the new content launches.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1298116.jpg\" id=\"1298116\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1298116.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Winds event on PTR\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"></a><br><span class=\"small-text\"></span></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>The <a href=\"/event=1636/winds-of-mysterious-fortune\">Winds of Mysterious Fortune</a> event ends tomorrow at 1 PM PDT, just a little less than 24 hours from now, so get in any last-minute leveling or reputation grinds before it disappears again!<br /><br />Winds of Mysterious Fortune Event Guide<br /><br />As usual, the winds feature a global buff for all players, featuring increased experience and reputation gains for almost everything outside of current content.<br /><br /><ul><li>20% bonus experience from level 10 to 89.</li><li>50% bonus reputation, excluding Zul'jarra's Forces and Captain Tokka's Crew.</li><li>Quests and kills while leveling characters can earn Mysterious Satchels.</li></ul><br /><br />As a bonus, it also included a brand-new Feat of Strength achievement offering bonus <a href=\"/currency=2032/traders-tender\">Trader's Tender</a>, which is very welcome in light of <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/september-trading-post-brings-back-over-300-player-favorites-and-previous-382696\">more than 300 items returning in this month's anniversary trading post</a>. While it's now too late to complete from start to finish, most active players should have already been getting credit naturally.<br /><br />The end of this most recent Winds event could also be an unofficial confirmation that Patch 12.1.5 is about to arrive. Although we have not yet gotten an official confirmation of the patch date, these events often bookend patches, allowing players to more easily catch up before the new content launches.<br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
